### Update Loan 
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/employee/LoanApplications(842f2408-b6c4-422a-825b-fd8764c4bcb8)
Authorization: Basic requester:requester
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": "70000"
}

### Submit Loan
POST {{baseUrl}}/employee/submitLoan
Authorization: Basic requester:requester
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "loanID": "3f5dd8bf-9aae-4651-a203-61bb762881c9"
}

### Approve Loan
POST {{baseUrl}}/employee/approveLoan
Authorization: Basic approver:approver
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "loanID": "3f5dd8bf-9aae-4651-a203-61bb762881c9"
}

### Reject Loan
POST {{baseUrl}}/employee/rejectLoan
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "loanID": "3f5dd8bf-9aae-4651-a203-61bb762881c9"
}